end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"hSYhYGrYLS"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".tex","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"BdXIYpapcf"},{"type":"text","value":" en document PDF. Tant un éditeur (c’est-à-dire TeXstudio) qu’une distribution TeX sont nécessaires, car l’éditeur seul ne peut pas compiler le code, et la distribution seule ne fournit pas un environnement intégré pour l’écriture et la gestion des documents LaTeX. Par conséquent, avant d’installer l’éditeur graphique LaTeX, assurez-vous d’installer une distribution TeX -- l’éditeur LaTeX tentera de trouver la distribution TeX installée lors de sa propre installation (étape suivante).","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"cHShhOOZJR"}],"key":"iXZYMLsxz6"},{"type":"admonition","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"LaTeX package installation","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1},"end":{"line":66,"column":1}},"key":"wOuHOJakbF"}],"key":"UWJXbtZfmH"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"LaTeX packages are collections of additional commands, macros, and formatting instructions that extend the capabilities of the LaTeX system. Packages are typically introduced into a TeX document by including commands such as ","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"key":"GODXqj6l74"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\\usepackage{...}","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"key":"rlyVzs3R2Z"},{"type":"text","value":" in the preamble of a ","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"key":"xMrVCbRCUv"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".tex","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"key":"u4vxv9oLhb"},{"type":"text","value":" file. This allows authors to leverage specialized functionality, such as enhanced math notations, improved bibliography management, or particular typographic styles, without having to redefine or recode basic LaTeX commands. A TeX distribution comes bundled with a large set of commonly used packages and is often configured to retrieve more packages as needed. If a source file calls for a package that is not installed locally, the distribution can automatically download and install it from a central repository, ensuring that you have the resources required to compile the ","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"key":"fr1Il49frP"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".tex","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"key":"IXVQeQqnnR"},{"type":"text","value":" file into a PDF document without manually searching and installing additional files.","position":{"start":{"line":69,"column":1},"end":{"line":69,"column":1}},"key":"gGivm6ve60"}],"key":"tYwZtDGskv"},{"type":"tabSet","children":[{"type":"tabItem","title":"Linux (Debian)","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":1},"end":{"line":73,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Les utilisateurs de Debian Linux peuvent simplifier l’installation des paquets en installant en vrac tous les paquets TeX Live disponibles avec ","position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":1},"end":{"line":73,"column":1}},"key":"gDk6901nSU"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sudo apt install texlive-full","position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":1},"end":{"line":73,"column":1}},"key":"WsG2teopPk"},{"type":"text","value":", mais cela prendra 3-4 Go d’espace disque.","position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":1},"end":{"line":73,"column":1}},"key":"nKQCBNeEiV"}],"key":"lejCqIR4PA"}],"key":"bfXcRcy4Qy"},{"type":"tabItem","title":"Windows","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Il est conseillé aux utilisateurs de Windows d’installer MiKTeX en utilisant un compte utilisateur standard plutôt que des privilèges d’administrateur. Cela permet à MiKTeX de télécharger et d’installer de nouveaux paquets ","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"key":"CwLS0BkayN"},{"type":"emphasis","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"à la volée","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"key":"a22GFyRqfY"}],"key":"e1UYKP8LAi"},{"type":"text","value":" sans demander à plusieurs reprises des autorisations à l’échelle du système. Si MiKTeX était installé par un administrateur, toute installation supplémentaire de paquets nécessiterait des droits élevés et inciterait l’utilisateur à s’authentifier en tant qu’administrateur à chaque fois, un processus qui est à la fois gênant et potentiellement moins sécurisé. Au lieu de cela, effectuer une installation de niveau utilisateur garantit que MiKTeX peut écrire des paquets directement dans les répertoires utilisateurs actuels. Lors de l’installation, sélectionnez l’option d’installation réservée à l’utilisateur et répondez « Non » lorsque vous êtes invité à utiliser les droits d’administrateur. Après la configuration, ouvrez le panneau de paramètres MiKTeX et confirmez que l’installation du paquet ","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"key":"zPdaop5oTw"},{"type":"emphasis","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"on-the-fly","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"key":"Qsjm63KQ0M"}],"key":"oK4MfTuHZz"},{"type":"text","value":" est activée.","position":{"start":{"line":78,"column":1},"end":{"line":78,"column":1}},"key":"hiRENMiJYr"}],"key":"zqaMAgswOF"}],"key":"UzAw7K5xss"}],"key":"yLTO2VJTIn"}],"class":"important","key":"rJz5BFgpwD"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":85,"column":1},"end":{"li